OL,3,AThe Zombies' Rod Argent back on stage
OL,4,Aafter stroke
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Zombies founding member Rod Argent
OL,7,Fhas returned to the stage for his first
OL,8,Flive performance in two and a half
OL,9,Fyears after suffering a stroke.
OL,11,FThe 81-year-old keyboardist said he had
OL,12,Ffelt "really nervous" before joining
OL,13,Fbandmate Colin Blunstone at St Albans
OL,14,FCathedral as part of the band's annual
OL,15,FBegin Here Festival.
OL,17,FFounded in the Hertfordshire city in
OL,18,F1962, the band most recently became
OL,19,Factive again in 2004 before stopping
OL,20,Fafter Argent's stroke in July 2024.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
